      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Modulus mismatch at the interfaces impedes dislocation transmission.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lattice-parameter mismatch at the interfaces impedes dislocation transmission.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial mismatch impedes dislocation accumulation at grain boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 300 MPa and 700 °C, the multilayer will have a steady-state creep rate at least five times lower than a monolithic coating of the same average composition, thickness, and columnar microstructure.",
